## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily Standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished offline support and the CI/CD pipeline, and shipped version 1.1.0 through it end to end.*
> *This week I'm adding an AI feature — a nutrition assistant. Today I set up a Supabase Edge Function as a proxy so the model key never leaves the server, with auth and rate limiting in front of it. Then I wired up the AI SDK on the client with streaming.*
> *One thing I did that I'd recommend to anyone: I unzipped the APK and grepped for the key prefix, just to confirm it genuinely isn't in the bundle. Knowing something is safe and verifying it are different things.*
> *I've also started applying — three applications a day from now on."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `never leaves the server` | không rời khỏi server | *The key never leaves the server.* |
| `in front of` | đứng chắn phía trước | *Auth and rate limiting in front of it.* |
| `grep for` | tìm chuỗi trong file | *I grepped for the key prefix.* |
| `token` (LLM) | đơn vị tính của mô hình | *Capped at 300 output tokens.* |
| `stream` (v) | truyền dần từng phần | *The response streams in.* |

